@startuml
!include style.puml
title Implemented pickup collection and synchronous Observer delivery
participant ArenaRun as Run
participant ArenaRules as Rules
participant World
participant EventBus as Bus
participant HudObserver as Hud
participant EventLogObserver as Log
note over Run,Rules
AI, motion and overlap detection have completed.
end note
Run -> Rules : applyCollisions(world, pairs, dt, tick)
Rules -> World : enqueueRemove(pickupId, COLLECTED)
World -> World : mark unavailable
Rules -> Rules : increase score once
Rules -> Bus : publish(ItemCollected)
Bus -> Hud : update score
Bus -> Log : append collection
Run -> World : commitChanges(tick)
World -> World : remove pickup
World -> Bus : publish(EntityRemoved)
Bus -> Log : append removal line
Run -> Rules : evaluateOutcome(world, tick)
opt first terminal transition
  Rules -> Bus : publish(GameFinished)
  Bus -> Hud : store result
  Bus -> Log : append outcome
end
note over Rules,Hud
Rules own gameplay state.
HUD follows notifications and is not read by rules.
Closing the log leaves HUD subscriptions active.
end note
@enduml
